{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52016","headline":"春园兴後 · 王绩","name":"春园兴後","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"比日寻常醉，经年独未醒。\n回瞻後园柳，忽值数行青。\n定是春来意，低头更好听。\n歌莺辽乱动，莲叶绕池生。\n散腰追阮籍，招手唤刘伶。\n隔架窥前[空，未余几]（据李抄本补）小瓶。\n风光须用却，留此待谁倾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王绩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52016.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52016","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}